{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44796","headline":"陈九溪中草堂 · 法振","name":"陈九溪中草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪草落溅溅，鱼飞入稻田。\n早寒临洞月，轻素卷帘烟。\n䪻帻题新句，蓑衣象古贤。\n曙花闲秀色，三十六峰前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法振","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44796.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44796","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}